---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout active="home">

  <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero__wrap">
      <div class="hero__top" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">Index — 01 / Welcome</p>
        <p class="mono hero__loc"><span class="pulse" style="display:inline-block;margin-right:8px;"></span> Telehealth · VA &amp; NY</p>
      </div>

      <h1 class="display hero__h" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
        It's time to<br/>
        find your way<br/>
        <em>forward.</em>
      </h1>

      <div class="hero__meta" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
        <div class="hero__col">
          <p class="mono hero__label">Practice</p>
          <p class="hero__val">Online mental-health counseling<br/>with Kevin Roche, LMHC · LPC</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__col">
          <p class="mono hero__label">Modalities</p>
          <p class="hero__val">Dialectical Behavior Therapy<br/>Self-Compassion Therapy</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__col">
          <p class="mono hero__label">Sessions</p>
          <p class="hero__val">50 minutes · weekly<br/>Most major insurance accepted</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero__cta" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://calendly.com/kevinrochelpc/consultation-call" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span>Book a free consult</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#approach">
          <span>How we work</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Asymmetric collage panel -->
      <div class="hero__art" aria-hidden="true">
        <figure class="hero__art-1" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
          <img src="/images/path-forest.jpg" alt="" loading="eager"/>
          <figcaption class="mono">Plate 01 — open path</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="hero__quote" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="4">
          <span class="display hero__quote-mark">"</span>
          <p class="hero__quote-t">
            The place to improve the world is first in one's own heart and head and hands.
          </p>
          <p class="mono hero__quote-by">— Robert M. Pirsig</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="hero__art-2" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">
          <img src="/images/sunrise.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"/>
          <figcaption class="mono">Plate 02 — morning</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Ticker -->
    <div class="ticker" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="ticker__track">
        {Array.from({length: 4}).map(() => (
          <span class="ticker__item">
            <span>Today, therapy is in reach</span><span class="ticker__dot">✶</span>
            <span>Compassion over criticism</span><span class="ticker__dot">✶</span>
            <span>Meet on Zoom, anywhere in VA &amp; NY</span><span class="ticker__dot">✶</span>
            <span>Accepting new clients</span><span class="ticker__dot">✶</span>
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ APPROACH ============ -->
  <section id="approach" class="approach">
    <div class="wrap approach__wrap">
      <div class="approach__intro">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Index — 02 / Approach</p>
        <h2 class="display approach__h" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
          A practice grounded in <em>what you can</em> change —
          <br/>and gentle about <em>what you can't.</em>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="approach__grid">
        <div class="approach__lead" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
          <p>
            Therapy here begins with a simple idea: focus on what's controllable,
            and let go — at least a little — of what isn't. From that quiet pivot,
            real change tends to follow.
          </p>
          <p class="muted">
            Together we'll build skills you can actually carry into the rest of
            your week. Not affirmations. Tools.
          </p>
        </div>

        <ol class="pillars">
          <li class="pillar" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
            <p class="mono pillar__n">01</p>
            <h3 class="pillar__h">Listen first.</h3>
            <p class="pillar__p">No script. We start with where you actually are — the loop, the worry, the relationship, the day.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="pillar" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">
            <p class="mono pillar__n">02</p>
            <h3 class="pillar__h">Name it clearly.</h3>
            <p class="pillar__p">Words for the thing make it workable. We translate vague distress into something you can hold and respond to.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="pillar" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="4">
            <p class="mono pillar__n">03</p>
            <h3 class="pillar__h">Build small skills.</h3>
            <p class="pillar__p">DBT and self-compassion give you concrete moves. You leave each session with something to try.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="pillar" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="5">
            <p class="mono pillar__n">04</p>
            <h3 class="pillar__h">Stay kind.</h3>
            <p class="pillar__p">Progress is rarely linear. Self-criticism rarely helps. We practice meeting yourself the way a friend would.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ SERVICES ============ -->
  <section id="services" class="svcs">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="svcs__head">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Index — 03 / Services</p>
        <h2 class="display svcs__h" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
          Two evidence-based<br/> paths, woven together.
        </h2>
        <p class="svcs__sub muted" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
          Sessions move fluidly between modalities — whichever serves the week you're in.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="svcs__grid">
        <article class="svc" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
          <div class="svc__head">
            <span class="tag"><span class="pulse" style="background:var(--moss);"></span> Modality 01</span>
            <h3 class="display svc__h">Dialectical<br/>Behavior Therapy.</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="svc__p">
            A practical framework for big emotions, fraught relationships, and the
            patterns we'd rather not repeat. DBT teaches four skill sets you can
            actually use: mindfulness, distress tolerance, emotion regulation,
            and interpersonal effectiveness.
          </p>
          <ul class="svc__list">
            <li>Mindfulness — staying present without bracing</li>
            <li>Distress tolerance — riding waves you can't fix</li>
            <li>Emotion regulation — fewer hijacks, more choices</li>
            <li>Interpersonal effectiveness — saying the thing, well</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="tlink" href="/services#dbt">Read more about DBT <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
        </article>

        <article class="svc svc--alt" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">
          <div class="svc__head">
            <span class="tag"><span class="pulse" style="background:var(--clay);"></span> Modality 02</span>
            <h3 class="display svc__h">Self-Compassion<br/>Therapy.</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="svc__p">
            Most of us are remarkably hard on ourselves — and surprised when that
            doesn't make things better. Self-compassion practice is the slow,
            steady work of treating yourself the way you'd treat someone you love
            who happened to be in the same trouble.
          </p>
          <ul class="svc__list">
            <li>Soften the inner critic without silencing it</li>
            <li>Notice shared humanity in private struggle</li>
            <li>Build a mindful, kind relationship to setbacks</li>
            <li>Use kindness as a method, not a feeling</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="tlink" href="/services#self-compassion">Read more about this approach <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ ABOUT KEVIN ============ -->
  <section class="about">
    <div class="wrap about__wrap">
      <div class="about__photo" data-reveal>
        <img src="/images/kevin.jpg" alt="Kevin Roche, LMHC LPC, founder of Finding Forward"/>
        <div class="about__photo-tag mono">
          <span>Kevin Roche</span>
          <span>LMHC · LPC</span>
        </div>
        <span class="about__sticker display">est. <em>2021</em></span>
      </div>
      <div class="about__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Index — 04 / Practitioner</p>
        <h2 class="display about__h" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
          Hi, I'm <em>Kevin.</em><br/>
          I'll be the one across the screen.
        </h2>
        <div class="about__body" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
          <p>
            I'm a licensed therapist in New York and Virginia, and the founder of
            Finding Forward. I work with adults who are tired of feeling stuck —
            in old patterns, in difficult relationships, in stories they've
            outgrown — and ready to try something quieter and more deliberate.
          </p>
          <p>
            My sessions tend to be conversational, warm, and direct. I'll ask
            real questions, I won't pretend to have a script, and I'll bring
            tools when tools help.
          </p>
        </div>
        <dl class="creds" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">
          <div><dt class="mono">License · NY</dt><dd>009382</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="mono">License · VA</dt><dd>0701010208</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="mono">Modalities</dt><dd>DBT · Self-Compassion</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="mono">Format</dt><dd>Telehealth · 50&nbsp;min</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <a class="tlink" href="/about" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="4">More about me <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ GETTING STARTED ============ -->
  <section id="start" class="start">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Index — 05 / Begin</p>
      <h2 class="display start__h" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
        Three small steps from<br/>
        <em>here</em> to your first session.
      </h2>

      <ol class="steps">
        <li class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
          <p class="step__n display">01</p>
          <h3 class="step__h">Check benefits</h3>
          <p class="step__p">Find out in a minute whether your plan covers therapy — there's a calculator linked below.</p>
          <a class="tlink" href="https://headway.co/does-my-insurance-cover-therapy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Check insurance <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
        </li>
        <li class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">
          <p class="step__n display">02</p>
          <h3 class="step__h">Book a consult</h3>
          <p class="step__p">A free, 20-minute call. We get a feel for fit and answer any questions before you commit.</p>
          <a class="tlink" href="https://calendly.com/kevinrochelpc/consultation-call" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Schedule a call <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
        </li>
        <li class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="4">
          <p class="step__n display">03</p>
          <h3 class="step__h">Begin the work</h3>
          <p class="step__p">If we click, you'll get a portal link, paperwork, and a regular session time. We start the following week.</p>
          <a class="tlink" href="/about">What to expect <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ TESTIMONIALS ============ -->
  <section class="quotes">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Index — 06 / In their words</p>
      <div class="quotes__grid">
        <blockquote class="q q--main" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
          <p class="display q__t">
            "I came in expecting <em>tools</em> and left with something <em>quieter</em> —
            permission to be a person while I worked on being a better one."
          </p>
          <footer class="q__by mono">— Client, NY · 2024</footer>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="q" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
          <p class="q__t">"Kevin made the hard parts feel less like failures and more like data."</p>
          <footer class="q__by mono">— Client, VA</footer>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="q" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">
          <p class="q__t">"First therapist I've kept past three sessions. The DBT work changed how I argue."</p>
          <footer class="q__by mono">— Client, NY</footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* HERO ===================== */
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    padding-top: clamp(48px, 7vw, 88px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(64px, 8vw, 120px);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero__wrap {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px);
  }
  .hero__top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .hero__loc { font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .hero__h {
    font-size: clamp(64px, 12vw, 200px);
    font-weight: 320;
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    max-width: 13ch;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .hero__h em { color: var(--clay); }
  .hero__meta {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
    max-width: 880px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 24px;
  }
  .hero__label { color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .hero__val { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; max-width: none; }
  .hero__cta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }

  .hero__art {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .hero__art figure {
    position: absolute;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 4px;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(28, 38, 32, 0.18);
  }
  .hero__art figure::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: auto 0 0 0;
    height: 60px;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(28,38,32,0.55), transparent);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero__art figcaption {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 14px; left: 16px;
    color: var(--paper);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .hero__art img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .hero__art-1 {
    width: 280px; height: 360px;
    right: 0; top: 30px;
    transform: rotate(2deg);
  }
  .hero__art-2 {
    width: 220px; height: 160px;
    right: 160px; top: 470px;
    transform: rotate(-3deg);
  }
  .hero__quote {
    position: absolute;
    right: 60px;
    top: 660px;
    width: 320px;
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 24px 26px 22px;
    transform: rotate(1deg);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(28,38,32,0.06);
  }
  .hero__quote-mark {
    position: absolute;
    top: -28px; left: 14px;
    font-size: 80px;
    color: var(--clay);
    line-height: 1;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .hero__quote-t {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    font-weight: 360;
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .hero__quote-by { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-2); }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .hero__art { display: none; }
  }

  /* TICKER */
  .ticker {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px);
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 18px 0;
    background: var(--bone-2);
  }
  .ticker__track {
    display: flex;
    gap: 36px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    animation: marq 50s linear infinite;
    will-change: transform;
  }
  .ticker__item {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 36px;
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 360;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-variation-settings: "opsz" 144, "SOFT" 80;
  }
  .ticker__dot { color: var(--clay); font-style: normal; font-size: 16px; }
  @keyframes marq {
    to { transform: translateX(-25%); }
  }

  /* APPROACH ===================== */
  .approach {
    padding: clamp(80px, 10vw, 140px) 0;
    background: var(--bone);
    position: relative;
  }
  .approach__intro { max-width: 1000px; margin-bottom: clamp(48px, 6vw, 88px); display: grid; gap: 22px; }
  .approach__h { font-size: clamp(40px, 5.5vw, 88px); line-height: 0.98; }
  .approach__h em { color: var(--moss); }
  .approach__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: clamp(40px, 5vw, 80px);
  }
  .approach__lead { display: grid; gap: 18px; }
  .approach__lead p { font-size: 18px; max-width: 30ch; }

  .pillars {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--line);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .pillar {
    background: var(--bone);
    padding: 32px 28px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    align-content: start;
    transition: background 0.5s var(--ease);
  }
  .pillar:hover { background: var(--paper); }
  .pillar__n { color: var(--clay); font-weight: 500; }
  .pillar__h { font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.1; }
  .pillar__p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-2); }

  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .approach__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .pillars { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  /* SERVICES ===================== */
  .svcs {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    padding: clamp(80px, 10vw, 140px) 0;
    position: relative;
  }
  .svcs .eyebrow { color: var(--sage); }
  .svcs .eyebrow::before { background: var(--sage); }
  .svcs__head { display: grid; gap: 22px; max-width: 800px; margin-bottom: clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px); }
  .svcs__h { color: var(--paper); }
  .svcs__sub { color: rgba(250,245,234,0.7); font-size: 18px; }

  .svcs__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: rgba(250,245,234,0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(250,245,234,0.12);
  }
  .svc {
    background: var(--ink);
    padding: clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px);
    display: grid;
    gap: 24px;
    align-content: start;
    transition: background 0.6s var(--ease);
  }
  .svc:hover { background: var(--ink-2); }
  .svc--alt:hover { background: rgba(195, 107, 71, 0.06); }
  .svc__head { display: grid; gap: 18px; }
  .svc__h { font-size: clamp(38px, 4vw, 56px); line-height: 1; color: var(--paper); letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  .svc--alt .svc__h { color: var(--sun); font-style: italic; font-variation-settings: "opsz" 144, "SOFT" 100; }
  .svc__p { color: rgba(250,245,234,0.78); font-size: 16px; }
  .svc__list { list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 10px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(250,245,234,0.12); }
  .svc__list li {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(250,245,234,0.82);
    padding-left: 22px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .svc__list li::before {
    content: '✶';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 0;
    color: var(--sun);
  }
  .svc--alt .svc__list li::before { color: var(--clay); }
  .svc .tlink { color: var(--paper); border-color: rgba(250,245,234,0.4); }
  .svc .tlink:hover { color: var(--sun); border-color: var(--sun); }

  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .svcs__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  /* ABOUT ===================== */
  .about {
    padding: clamp(80px, 10vw, 140px) 0;
    background: var(--bone-2);
    position: relative;
  }
  .about__wrap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
    gap: clamp(40px, 5vw, 80px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .about__photo {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(28,38,32,0.15);
  }
  .about__photo img {
    width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 1.2s var(--ease);
  }
  .about__photo:hover img { transform: scale(1.04); }
  .about__photo-tag {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 16px; left: 16px;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .about__photo-tag span:last-child { color: var(--moss); }
  .about__sticker {
    position: absolute;
    top: -22px; right: -22px;
    width: 110px; height: 110px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    background: var(--clay);
    color: var(--paper);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 22px;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.05;
    font-variation-settings: "opsz" 144, "SOFT" 60;
    transform: rotate(-8deg);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(195,107,71,0.35);
  }
  .about__sticker em { display: block; font-size: 26px; font-variation-settings: "opsz" 144, "SOFT" 100; }

  .about__copy { display: grid; gap: 22px; }
  .about__h { font-size: clamp(40px, 4.5vw, 68px); line-height: 1.02; }
  .about__h em { color: var(--clay); }
  .about__body { display: grid; gap: 16px; }
  .about__body p { font-size: 17px; max-width: 56ch; }

  .creds {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 18px 32px;
    padding: 22px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .creds dt { color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .creds dd { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; }

  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .about__wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .about__sticker { width: 90px; height: 90px; top: -16px; right: -10px; font-size: 18px; }
    .about__sticker em { font-size: 22px; }
  }

  /* GETTING STARTED ===================== */
  .start { padding: clamp(80px, 10vw, 140px) 0; background: var(--bone); }
  .start__h {
    margin: 22px 0 clamp(48px, 6vw, 72px);
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5.5vw, 84px);
